// # Catalog Root Anchor - Signed Index Conformance Surface
//
// Logline: Re-exports the catalog manifest + index conformance checkers as the repository's anchor page.
// Setup: layers/<layer>/<pkg>/manifest + <pkg>.oo descriptor entries carry name/payload/sha256 fields
//        audited byte-exact by core/ and tests/; cli/main.oo is the catalog verifier binary.
// Beats:
//   1. core/cat_manifest.oo owns the bounded two-level walk and field-level manifest checks.
//   2. core/cat_index.oo owns the canonical descriptor emitter and index/groups/sums/sig gates.
//   3. tests/test_functional.oo proves the whole registry conforms byte-exact.
//   4. tests/test_refusal.oo proves forged, missing, and tampered entries fail closed.

import "core/cat_manifest.oo";
import "core/cat_index.oo";
